doc:sch-1-sec-15ab-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "15AB(2) Matters to be considered in certain bail applications" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) If a person referred to in subparagraph (1)(a)(i) or (ii) is living in, or otherwise located in, a remote community, the bail authority must also take into consideration that fact in considering the potential impact of granting bail on that person." ;
    cof:pageNumber "7"^^xsd:integer .

concept:crimes-amendment-bail-and-sentencing-act-2006-sch-1-sec-15ab-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15AB(3) Matters to be considered in certain bail applications"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-15ab-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) In paragraph (1)(b): criminal behaviour includes:  (a) any conduct, omission to act, circumstance or result that is, or forms part of, a physical element of the offence in question; and  (b) any fault element relating to such a physical element." ;
    skos:definition "(3) In paragraph (1)(b): criminal behaviour includes:  (a) any conduct, omission to act, circumstance or result that is, or forms part of, a physical element of the offence in question; and  (b) any fault element relating to such a physical element."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b612f92dd78b69c3faa1818c6ef2e712dbad2a98c0fdddc165e6316b605ef978" ;
    values:partOf concept:crimes-amendment-bail-and-sentencing-act-2006-sch-1-sec-15ab ;
    cof:pageNumber "7"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Defines criminal behaviour in certain bail applications." ;
