concept:crimes-amendment-bail-and-sentencing-act-2006-sch-1-sec-15ab-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15AB(4) Matters to be considered in certain bail applications"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-15ab-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) To avoid doubt, except as provided by subsections (1) and (2), this section does not affect:  (a) any other matters that a bail authority must, must not or may take into consideration in determining whether to grant bail or in determining conditions to which bail should be subject; or  (b) the operation of a law of a State or a Territory. Note: Subsections (1) and (2) indirectly affect laws of the States and Territories because they affect section 68 of the Judiciary Act 1903." ;
    skos:definition "(4) To avoid doubt, except as provided by subsections (1) and (2), this section does not affect:  (a) any other matters that a bail authority must, must not or may take into consideration in determining whether to grant bail or in determining conditions to which bail should be subject; or  (b) the operation of a law of a State or a Territory. Note: Subsections (1) and (2) indirectly affect laws of the States and Territories because they affect section 68 of the Judiciary Act 1903."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "46cc7e6799f9e6b4a67f30bf4a876301c3d5d23d64e1355b4e9a5a9844fcb16f" ;
    values:partOf concept:crimes-amendment-bail-and-sentencing-act-2006-sch-1-sec-15ab ;
    cof:pageNumber "7"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Exemptions from subsections (1) and (2)" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
