    cof:title "5(2B) After subsection 16A(2)" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2B) In subsection (2A): criminal behaviour includes:  Amendments  Schedule 1  (a) any conduct, omission to act, circumstance or result that is, or forms part of, a physical element of the offence in question; and  (b) any fault element relating to such a physical element." ;
