doc:sch-1-sec-6 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "6 Application of amendments" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The amendments made by items 1 to 3 of this Schedule apply, after the commencement of this Act, in relation to offences committed, or alleged to have been committed, before or after that commencement.  Amendments  Schedule 1  (2) The amendments made by items 4 to 5L of this Schedule do not apply in relation to offences committed before the commencement of this Act.  [Minister’s second reading speech made in— Senate on 14 September 2006 House of Representatives on 28 November 2006]  (139/06)" ;
    cof:pageNumber "10"^^xsd:integer .